      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大拓太阳神在训练中成为了一阵风！\n不过她从不考虑步调，经常会累瘫。\n训宝顺利地让她跟上了最棒的浪潮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c459a1d2230a60d3d6d63804c214855763c57b10b29ecf9c869053c4cd7ae85",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
