      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在那时候交流过的凯斯奇迹，\n是跟第一红宝石同寝室的温柔女孩☆\n顾虑到她还在调整身体状况──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba9883b752fd7059f9ea84ee1904ea7cb2db2f65a90ad1b874be61543148256f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
