    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be447127c75bff7594806191",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大拓太阳神提议大家一起慢慢地跑。\n跟好姐妹们一起，\n真的是最&棒了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3aeb7d72d6cc46aee5615efebdb1df9603f30e21cad90537b984beee95864a46",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
