      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大拓太阳神迫不及待想参加冬季的“阪神JF”。\n而且她也想参加更热血的祭典，\n2500米的“有马纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b39cf817c400a75628a026ba0f15d98b05e1e62444f8af103d0260984b651dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
