      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，目白善信则正在烦恼。\n身为竞赛界知名的目白家，\n是否应该参加正统的比赛──",
      "source_fingerprint": "12bdb8d8e206f9f9bd45af903dfb5cab61a738e72b80336c915519d52edda981",
